<title>USA: Old National Bancorp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Old National Bancorp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.57		    $0.44</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.56		    $0.43</p>
<p> Net			 15,454		   12,347</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	26,986		   28,017</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	28,420		   29,495</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE: All per-share data adjusted for stock dividends and splits including a five percent stock dividend paid January 29, 1997.  </p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.20		    $1.91</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$2.14		    $1.86</p>
<p> Net			 60,179		   53,939</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	27,415		   28,303</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	28,846		   29,781</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year results include one-time merger related charges, writeoffs and SAIF fees associated with the Q4 merger with Workingmen's Holding Co. Excluding those items, 1996 year net would have been $2.25/shr.</p>
<p>Assets $5.37 billion vs $5.10 billion</p>
<p>Deposits $4.27 billion vs $4.18 billion</p>
<p>Loans $3.52 billion vs $3.26 billion</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
